set total to 0.

when someone sends "/start", reply "Hi" and then their name and then "! Press a button." with buttons "+1" and "reset".

when someone sends "+1"
  add 1 to their count.
  add 1 to total.
  reply "Your count is" and then their count and then ". All users together:" and then total and then ".".
that's all.

when someone sends "reset"
  set their count to 0.
  reply "Your count is back to 0.".
that's all.

when someone sends anything else, reply "Press a button." with buttons "+1" and "reset".
